  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 2301.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 2301.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to implement the provisions of RSA 149-M:64, relative to prohibiting certain PFAS-added consumer products from being sold, offered for sale, or distributed for sale or promotional purposes in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #14658, eff 7-18-26, EXPIRES: 7-18-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw2300.html"
